hash_gen_opaque_outside_reject|check-fail|tests/safety/hash_gen_opaque_outside_reject.tl|-|hash.gen: Token must be generated in its canonical owner module owner_eq_hash_dep (current module <root>)
eq_gen_descendant_reject|check-fail|tests/safety/eq_gen_descendant_reject.tl|-|eq.gen: Token must be generated in its canonical owner module owner_eq_hash_dep (current module owner_eq_hash_dep.eq_descendant)
hash_gen_descendant_reject|check-fail|tests/safety/hash_gen_descendant_reject.tl|-|hash.gen: Token must be generated in its canonical owner module owner_eq_hash_dep (current module owner_eq_hash_dep.hash_descendant)
