hash_gen_missing_eq_reject|check-fail|tests/safety/hash_gen_missing_eq_reject.tl|-|needs its canonical owner hook eq-point in module <root>; add (eq.gen Point) there
eq_hook_missing_reject|check-fail|tests/safety/eq_hook_missing_reject.tl|-|eq: nominal type Point needs its canonical owner hook eq-point in module <root>; add (eq.gen Point) there or define (eq-point [left : (& left Point)] [right : (& right Point)]) : bool)
